<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλανθάνω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					3.16
				</span></i>
			, and as v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Acut.(Sp.).</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λήσομαι</span>: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέλαθον</span>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλέληθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					278a
				</span></i>
			:—<i>escape notice,</i> with part.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλήσει χρηστὸς ὤν</span>
			Isoc.l.c.; but also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλαθὼν ἐσέρχεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.25
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. pers., <i>escape the notice of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.4.19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὲ τοῦτο διαλέληθε</span>
			Pl.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				1.44
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ διαλεληθὼς</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>), a <i>fallacy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>abscond</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1187.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.285.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>.</div>
